==Cebuano==

===Pronunciation===
* {{hyphenation|he|li|kop|ter|lang=ceb}}

===Etymology 1===
Borrowed from {{bor|ceb|en|helicopter}}, borrowed from {{der|ceb|fr|hélicoptère}}, from {{der|ceb|grc|ἕλιξ||spiral}} + {{m|grc|πτερόν||wing}}.

====Noun====
{{head|ceb|noun}}

# a [[helicopter]]; an aircraft that is borne along by one or more sets of long rotating blades which allow it to hover, move in any direction including [[reverse]], or land; and having a smaller set of blades on its tail that stabilize the aircraft

====Verb====
{{head|ceb|verb}}

# to transport by helicopter
# to travel by helicopter

===Etymology 2===
After its resemblance to a helicopter.

====Noun====
{{head|ceb|noun}}

# {{lb|ceb|colloquial}} a [[dragonfly]]

